   $q$What does the author propose?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The city should repaint the underpass walls gray again.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-opposing-view"},{"text":"The city should close the underpass to stop the tagging.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Art teachers should paint the underpass during the summer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"Students should design and paint a mural on the underpass.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Students should design and paint a mural on the underpass.$q$, $q$The author writes, "invite students from the three nearby schools to design and paint a mural there." Repainting gray is the city's plan, which the author wants to replace.$q$, 'draft', '149f235a-7156-50bf-a282-bd3f18a3be01')
