   $q$What is the main difference between the author's position and the public works director's position?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She wants the underpass torn down, while the author wants to keep it standing.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She worries about cost and tagging, while the author believes a mural is worth it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She thinks murals are ugly, while the author thinks murals are always beautiful.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"She wants a mural painted by adults, while the author wants students to paint it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"not-in-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She worries about cost and tagging, while the author believes a mural is worth it.$q$, $q$The director "worries that a mural will cost more" and "fears that a mural will be covered by new tags," and the author answers both concerns in favor of the mural. The passage says nothing about her opinion of how murals look.$q$, 'draft', '149f235a-7156-50bf-a282-bd3f18a3be01')
